# File upload

- Do not store uploads on API server filesystem in production; use S3/R2 (store URL in DB)
- Validate file size/type/name (multer validators / options)
- For large uploads, prefer signed URL direct-to-storage uploads
- Consider virus scanning for untrusted uploads before processing

